== CPM Core Linux (0.14.0)

.Release Information
[width="30%"]
|====================================
| Date              | 2020-11-19
| Release Label/Tag | 0.14.0
| AIS Template		| 4.1.0 ALPHA_16
| Released By       | Subba Gundala
|====================================

== Release Summary Information

=== us878209 : DataLinkData SCS channel and DatalinkMgrToDld
	Updated DataLinkData SCS channel and DatalinkMgrToDld TaskPlugin 
	to support multiple source IDs for the same parameter.
	IMPORTANT: This required an interface change to the DataLinkData STL 
	container of parameters. The unordered_map<key, DataLinkParam> was 
	converted to a unordered_map<key, std::list<DataLinkParam>>, where
	the inner list contains one or more DataLinkParams with identical 
	DataLinkParamInfo metadata with the exception of SourceId and/or 
	DataLinkType.
	
=== us883232 : Jhm2WsServer to support converting WebSocket 
	Add Jhm2WsServer to support converting WebSocketrequests into 
	Jhm2ParamMsgRequest for use by the AisJhm2DataServer. Currently 
	supports ParameterRequest(2), FileRequest, and CommandRequest(2). 
	Parameter and File requests can be one-time or periodic.
	
	Moved the majority of jhm2 to legacy in favor of the AIS version. 
	Only jhm2CgiApp remains since the AIS version is incompatible with MWL
	See prod/common/jhm2WsServer/README.md for more details

=== us882913 : TES-Common-ais for compatibility with eta-ais
	Updated TES-Common-ais for compatibility with eta-ais ALPHA_16. 
	DatalinkManager interface has changed to support split Rx/Tx 
	parameters, and the same parameter from a different SourceId
	/DataLinkProtocol.
	
	Added platform/common for common includes/libraries, and updated 
	tes_platform.py.

=== us875060, us882913: CoachingTipHistory
	Added CoachingTipHistory and $CA11 (Application History PSR) 
	BDT support.

=== u879877: String to Show-Hde
	Add software version string to Show-Hde response.

=== us876725: Add getter for pwm last sample time.

=== us879573: Updates to support images.

=== us856259: Add csvToDldApp to sandbox.

=== us875539: Fix serial printer crash.

=== us878625: Clean up DatalinkMgrToDld plugin.

=== us873299: Reset breadcrumb on reset command.

=== us828924: Patches for latest ACD2
	Updated patches for latest ACD2 develop branch e28baa. 
	Updated Makefile.patch for latest acd2 develop branch. fix memory 
	leak when in DEBUG.

=== us877084: AFSW_SCL_2020.4.0.rc8 tag for health
	Pick up AFSW_SCL_2020.4.0.rc8 tag for health, dlinfo 
	and dlinfo_mager libs

=== Integration Information

To use ACD2, need to update the CPM project level SConstruct
to use some new functions from eta-ais. The diff from LWL 
Coaching as a reference archieved in Core Linux 0.13.0 release.
\TES-common-ais\patch\example\0_13_0_SConstruct.diff

One another change to make at the project level is to remove the 
const qualifier from app_oel_rtos_posix_config. This was done to 
support runtime configurable OEL tasks in OelTaskManager (used by ACD2). 
There is no functional impact on the existing code.

