== CPM Core Linux (0.11.0)

.Release Information
[width="30%"]
|====================================
| Date              | 2020-03-11
| Release Label/Tag | 0.11.0
| AIS Template		| 4.1
| Released By       | Subba Gundala
|====================================

== Release Summary Information

=== us805718 - BmiJ1939 health integration for FMI9/14 support (gundas1)

Added support for data link and node based diagnostics. FMI 9 and FMI 14 reported 
for PID, PGN, ADT protocols. These are reported in the DataLinkData diagnostics.
Note: This implementation will change new data link strategy in the future release. 
i.e., only FMI9 raised per data link. ET would request BDT file for the parameter 
diagnostics information.

=== us827224 - A6N2/N1 Analysis ECM Ethernet PGT server support (Part 1 PID) (machas3)

Add EthernetPgtServer plugin that can be integrated into the ACD or a standlone 
app (sandbox/EthernetPgtServerTest as an example). A project specific plugin 
must be created to feed the server 
(sandbox/EthernetPgtServerTest/EthernetPgtServerTestDataProducer.hpp
as an example).

Improved DataLinkData logging info. Note that the Parameter Name string is only 
included if the logging level is DEBUG.

SPN/CAT EXT ID support will be added in a later story.

=== us834233 - Fix memory leak in BmiEthernet  (machas3)

The csf_pgt_client library version 2018.2.0 has a memory leak. Add patch to use 
version 2019.4.0 of csf_pgt_client library.

=== us826802 - Improve DataLinkData (Part 2)  (machas3)

Simplified the STL container to allow more efficient retrieval using only 
Parameter ID and ParameterIdentifierType (PID, CAT EXT ID, etc).
If the same PID is sourced from multitple SIDs and/or DataLinkTypes, the 
producer must create multiple DataLinkData objects to publish.

Replace DlDataMap with an unordered_map, remove DlPidMap (NOTE: may 
require a minor change to the CPM project code if the iterator
type returned by GetDataLinkDataMapPtr is hard coded.

Remove DataLinkType from DataLinkParamInfo in favor of DataLinkData's version
(NOTE: might require a CPM project code change for producers of DataLinkData).

Add a source field so that a producer can avoid consuming its own DataLinkData.

Delete deprecated GetXXXParamInfoXXX functions.

=== us832682 - bmiEthernet, all ParamType are 0 in DataLinkData  (machas3)

Fix bug caused by confusion between ParameterType and ParameterIdentifierType 

=== us829539 - Fix app_init.sh, Standardize ActiveTasks and ProductionLogger  (machas3)

Fix bug in app_int.sh where robot file is not being created if it doesn't exist

Improve ActiveTasks to load CPM specific task files in production scenario. 
Add instructions for how to use scenarios.

ProductionLogger_*.rb does not need all in the CPM interfaces. Remove 
ProductionLogger_CpmCommon.rb and update the example to override the 
ProductionLogger paramters only.

=== us832482 - add DataLinkData-OCS plugin  (machas3)

Added DataLinkData Monitor OCS plugin.

=== us832745 investigate/fix xcp server on VM  (machas3)

Updated XCP Server allow IP Address to be configurable from ruby to support 
debugging on VM (default is still 165.26.79.19).

To take advantage of this change, see app/xcp_server/README

=== us832716 -  Merge COACHING_INT updates into TES Common 0.11.0  (machas3)

us723169 - Sync with AIS ALPHA 11. Added A6N1 build support. Removed 
rapidjson 1.1.0. Added A6NX platform with common includes and libs, this 
allows the CPM build process to be decoupled from AIS/TES common 
platformCommon changes (see doc/ssp_setup/app/SConstruct for details).
Added tes_platform.py module to handle importing of libraries/includes. 
Added build targets for patching eta-ais files. Downgraded to 
CSF_ETH_HEALTH_2019.2.0 to resolve A6N1 issue with BmiEthernet.

us818875 - Update productionActiveTasks.rb to load project specific 
ActiveTask_* files. Converted CoachingShowHideStatus to an SCS 
channel, added coachingEnabled, coachingInstalled, machineInSafeState.

=== us786115 - Add coachingSystemEnabled to CoachingTask, set based on InternalMsn  (machas3)

=== us829404 - Add support for variant build directories (needed by MWL for SA/AU2020)  (machas3)

=== us825219 - Fix UI Reset in CoachingSummaryData and Coaching3x3Data  (machas3)

=== us829018 - Add .rb default config for Installed and Enabled  (machas3)

=== us837288 - Update to 4 Poisson thresholds for scoring tips.

=== us710280 - VP3Record.h - added new add_data_to_record template for string data  (machas3)

Added to support MG.

=== us812418 - SerialPrinter app stalls  (shattar)

Fix issue where printer app would stall when printing large tickets.

=== us822921 - VP3 cycle segmentation data issues  (shattar)

Make sure VP3 file starts with status record.  Fix memory leak in VP3FileCreationApp.

=== us829404 - Separate build directories for different target variants  (shattar)

Support separate build directories for different build variants and targets.

=== us829147 - Add deadlines to grpc calls in CdaIoTHubComms  (shattar)

Add deadlines (timeouts) to IoT hub related gRPC calls so they don’t block forever.

=== us818962 - single mal-named VP3 file halts all files being sent to back office  (shattar)

Skip FTB file transfers with bad file names that were clogging the tx queue.

=== us831538 - Limit number of vp3 files held for local download  (shattar)

Add configurable maximum number of files kept for VP3 local download.

=== us826967 - Update offboard message interface  (shattar)

Add support for “one-shot” IoTHub messages where it will try once and discard on fail.

=== us758750 - ListMgr update csv file import and export format  (shattar)

Updated csv file format for truck and material lists to match the back office format.

=== us832902 - VP3FileCreatorApp status record - revisit  (shattar)

Added default status record for VP3 files, and make the requirement of a status record optional/configurable.

=== us821961 - Print tickets to YK over CDA-SFT  (shattar)

Add remote printer app.

=== us833488 - PWM inputs not reporting correct faults  (shattar)

Add input state and timeout support to PWM inputs.

=== us831099 - Reduce vp3 creation rate to increase file size  (shattar)

Support “Triggered” VP3 file creation as triggered by product link through FTB, minor 
fixed to get it to work.
Minor updates to AppReg.h, nvm.hpp, CreateFileRequest.h, and PartNumbers.h

=== us841165 - VP3 header records must be at beginning and FTB fixes  (shattar)

Fix the order of records in the VP3 file so that the header records are first.  Removed config
part num from header.
Fixed thread deadlock (stalled) issue in FTB by adding deadlines (timeouts) to CDA 
transmits.
Fixed issue in FTB ConnectToCDAServer where it would connect, then disconnect, then 
connect again instead of just connecting once.

=== us841184 – BmiJ1939 now using “instance name”  (shattar)

BmiJ1939 now using “instance name” as AppReg name so that apps can register to more that one 
instance of BmiJ1939.
Changed key off timeout to 32 minutes for FTB and VP3 Creator.  This is so that we can stay 
alive longer than the engine (max 30 minutes) and record those segment records.
		   
=== us829545 – BmiJ1939 fixes  (shattar)

Fixed BmiJ1939 app crashes when PGN times out.
Fixed BmiJ1939 runs at 100% CPU in clean up.
					  
=== Integration Information

1. eta-ais AIS_APP_TEMPLATE_4.1.0_ALPHA_11 is required.
2. The ssp Makefile must be updated to build the apply_ais_patch_all target in TES-common-ais:

# Prefix for the application verity file.  Used in zzzAutostart.
APP_VERITY_PREFIX=CPM

    # Patch AIS files. See TES-common-ais Makefile for details
	make apply_patch_ais_all APP_VERITY_PREFIX=${APP_VERITY_PREFIX} -C ${TES_DIR}

3. The CPM project SConstruct should be updated to include the PLATFORM in the build flags:

baseEnv.Append(
    CCFLAGS = [
        ...
        '-DRAPIDJSON_HAS_STDSTRING=1',
        ('-D%s=' %(baseEnv['PLATFORM']).replace('-', '_')), # Add PLATFORM to build flags, hyphens not permitted
    ]

4. Any apps using the GetDataLinkDataMapPtr interface of DataLinkData may have to update iterator handling code.

5. Any apps getting/setting the DataLinkType of DataLinkParam will have to instead get/set from the DataLinkData object.


