== CPM Core Linux (0.10.0)

.Release Information
[width="30%"]
|====================================
| Date              | 2019-11-11
| Release Label/Tag | 0.10.0
| AIS Template		| 4.1
| Released By       | Subba Gundala
|====================================

== Release Summary Information

=== us823378 - Update DLD output channel publish to call HandleDataLinkDataMap and ClearDlpDiagInfo (machas3)

Updated DataLinkDataOutputChannel::publish to call HandleDataLinkDataMap and ClearDlpDiagInfo. 
Updated Bmi apps to remove these function calls.

=== us788956, us826338 - Remove custom lighttpd configs, instead use ServiceDashboard's defaults (machas3)

Removed custom lighttpd configs, instead ServiceDashboard's defaults will be used  Added custom 
app_init.sh and restart_mon.sh for zzzAutostart and updated example ssp Makefile for their use.

=== us822801 - Optimize FileTransferBridgeApp memory usage (gulamhs)

Fixed ssl lib usage memory leak in FileTransferBridgeApp.

=== us828299 - Increase canv3 buffer size in BmiJ1939 (gulamhs)

Increased canv3 buffer size in BmiJ1939 from {150, 350} to {1000, 1000}.

=== us820538 - Add config/production/ActiveTasks.rb to run ProductionLogger by default (machas3)

Added config/production/ActiveTasks.rb to run ProductionLogger by default.  Usage instructions:
1. Copy DOC_DIR/app/config/DataTypeTable_CPM.rb (suffix must match DATATYPETABLE in the ssp Makefile).  
   Add any CPM Project specific scs channels.
2. Create a CPM_DIR/config/ProductionLogger_CPM.rb with these SCS channels 
   (use config/ProductionLogger_CpmCommon.rb as a reference).
    
=== us820782 - Create TaskPlugin and TaskPluginMgr classes to support the sharing of modular plugins (machas3, gundas1)

Created TaskPlugin and TaskPluginMgr classes to support the sharing of modular plugins between 
projects that have similar needs.  Usage instructions are in prod/infrastructure/plugins/TaskPlugin/README.

Created EthernetPortStatistics ACD plugin to provide a BDT to ET.  Usage instructions are in 
prod/infrastructure/plugins/EthernetPortStatistics/README.
 
=== us812368 - Create DataLinkDataReceiver plugin (machas3)

Created DataLinkDataReceiver plugin.  This plugin is used to allow multiple other plugins to 
share a single DataLinkData scs input channel.  Usage instructions are in 
prod/infrastructure/plugins/DataLinkDataReceiver/README.

Updated DataLinkData diagnostics to store based on cid and mid.  This change should be transparent 
to the producer/consumer.

Added DataLinkType to DataLinkData class.  This can be used by the consumer to use/ignore an entire 
DataLinkData object based on DataLinkType (such as when used for reporting FMI diagnostics).

Updated BmiJ1939 to set CAN1/CAN2 in DataLinkData based on ruby config.

=== us812328 - Create DataLinkDataPublisher plugin (machas3)

Created DataLinkDataPublisher plugin.  This plugin is used to allow multiple other plugins to 
share a single DataLinkData scs output channel.  Usage instructions are in 
prod/infrastructure/plugins/DataLinkDataPublisher/README.

Updated jhm2 version of rapidjson to 1.1.0.  Moved to local machineCommon until AIS updates.  
To use, add the following to platform/A6N2/includes-list.txt:

    #../../TES-common-ais/build-A6N2/prod/machineCommon/content/prod/common
    
If there are any CPM project apps that use rapidjson:

    - Replace all cases of "include <jhm2/rapidjson" with "#include <rapidjson".
    
    - Remove all cases of 
    
        #define RAPIDJSON_NAMESPACE rapidjson110
        #define RAPIDJSON_HAS_STDSTRING 1
    
    - Replace all "rapidjson110" references with "rapidjson"
    
    - Add the following to CCFlags in SConstruct
    
    '-DRAPIDJSON_HAS_STDSTRING=1',

Added DataLinkData::GetLastPIDValueIfReceived.  Updated DataLinkParam to set PIDDataReceived to 
true if value is updated.

Added displayRequired to CoachingSummaryData.

