== CPM Core Linux (0.9.0)

.Release Information
[width="30%"]
|====================================
| Date              | 2019-08-16
| Release Label/Tag | 0.9.0
| AIS Template		| 4.1
| Released By       | Subba Gundala
|====================================

== Release Summary Information

=== us709871 - Upgrade from ais 4.0 to 4.1 for CPM projects   (machas3)

Updated TES Common to use eta-ais template app 4.1.  This was primarily tested with 
AIS_APP_TEMPLATE_4.1.0_ALPHA_08, but should be compatible with AIS_APP_TEMPLATE_4.1.0_ALPHA_10.

The major features of 4.1 are:
	-	Access to latest AIS content (4.0 app is deprecated and is only updated with critical 
		content).

	-	The ability to build for multiple targets at once (e.g. ‘make project_a6n2’ will not 
		overwrite the output from ‘make project_ocs’ and vice versa).
	
	-	Dramatically improved build time for ‘make release’.

	-	Improved syncSoftware.  ‘make verity_all_a6n2’ now creates 4 total verities: CPM, 
		zzzAutostart, ossSoftware, DefaultConfig.  syncSoftware will transfer the latter 
		3 verities to the ECM and will copy the CPM specific bin/lib/config directories 
		to /opt as r/w so they can be overwritten as needed.  This makes it a much 
		quicker and versatile option for debugging than making a verity for the CPM 
		content.

==== Note: 
Instructions for updating existing/creating new CPM super projects can be found in 
doc/ssp_setup (ais_4.1_migration.txt and new_ssp_setup.txt, respectively).  Updated build 
commands are in doc/build_commands.txt

=== us791997 - Update FileTransferBridgeApp to use cert_manager_protobuf lib in AIS 4.1   (machas3)

Compiled FileTransferBridgeApp using libcert_manager_protobuf.a for CDA 2019.5.0

==== Note: 
By default, FileTransferBridgeApp is compiled using CDA_2018.5.0.  It can be compiled 
using CDA_2019.5.0, but as of this release it will not communicate with the Telematics 
Yellow Key to send VP3 files.

=== us808085 - AT Coaching: use bmi_J1939 to request Lat-Long    (machas3)

In GPSDataLinkParam added option for GetGpsLatitude/Longitude to return 0-180/0-360 ranges 
per CDL PID $F84D.

=== us786826, us794229, us794515, us795396, us796556, us796569, us799453, us799669, us800895, 
us801042, us801044, us805350, us805512, - Create CoachingTask (machas3)

Created CoachingTask and related SCS channels.  Use by copying sandbox/CoachingTaskExample 
folder to the CPM project apps directory and updating it for the specific application.

Added the following functions to prod/common/fileio:

-	tes_common_ais::directory::copy - Copies all files and folders in the source to dest.  
-	tes_common_ais::nvm::read, store - Added support for serializing multiple objects to 
	a single file.
-	tes_common_ais::nvm::count - Returns the number of nvm records stored in the provided
	path.
-	tes_common_ais::nvm::deleteOldest - Deletes the oldest nvm records stored in the 
	provided path.

=== Merged TES Common 0.8.1 updates (gundas1)
    Merged TES Common 0.8.1 release updates into 0.9.0 release.
	
==== Note:
- 0.9.0 updated to use AIS eta-ais template app 4.1.
- 0.8.1 using AIS eta-ais template app 4.0 in maintenance mode. 
Only critical updates will be added in the future.

