== Release Summary Information

=== us777873 - Resolve VP3Record compile warnings (gundas1)

Resolved compile warnings in VP3Record that are elevated to errors if -Werror flag is used

=== us770211 - Add Bmi Support for unsupported/generic variable length PIDs (gundas1)

Previously, BmiCdl and BmiJ1939 only supported specific variable length PIDs (GPS, TIME_ZONE, PRODUCT_ID)
that had their own entries in VarLengthDataLinkParamParamPool.  With this release, if the
VarLengthDataType (BmiJ1939) or VarLengthParamType (BmiCdl) is set to UNSUPPORTED, the received
data will be stored in DataLinkParmInfo.  It is the client's responsibility to interpret/decode the "raw"
data array returned by GetVarParamBlock().

=== us756006 - Add spreadsheet to generate BmiJ1939/BmiCdl/BmiEthernet json files (gundas1)

Instead of manually generating the bmi json files, the desired parameters can be added to one or more 
spreadsheets that will autogenerate the files.  If desired, this autogeneration can be done at application 
compile time.  Note that it is necessary to install LibreOffice in the Virtual Machine to use this feature.

The instructions are documented in config/bmi_autogen_readme.txt

=== us722372 - Add Security System Current Key (gundas1)

To support the "OperatorIDCsv" feature, a VariableDatatLinkParam was added for Security System Current Key.
CPMOperatorIdList was also added to support csv upload/download and json responses to the UI.

=== us748445 – BMI CDL app Automated regression test (gundas1)

Developed Python scripts to Automate the test of BMI CDL app through Vbench. Various test JSON files with all combinations of the protocol are used to test. Note that it is necessary to enable the automation testing in the BMI CDL app SConscript. The Instructions are documented in  apps/TestAutomation /BmiCdl/Manual_BMI_CDL_Automation_Test.docx.

=== us748445 – BMI CDL app Automated regression test (gundas1)

Developed Python scripts to Automate the test of BMI J1939 app through Vbench. Various test JSON files with all combinations of the protocol are used to test. Note that it is necessary to enable the automation testing in the BMI J1939 app SConscript. The Instructions are documented in  apps/TestAutomation /BmiJ1939/Manual_BMI_J1939_Automation_Test.docx.

=== us777835 - Support VP3 file local download (gundas1)

Added vp3 file local download support and fixed some file transfer bridge file system error handling.

=== us773707 - Add SPN support to BmiEthernet App (gundas1)

BmiEthernet support publishing raw data for requested SPN. 
Note: there was no simulator available to verify this functionality. This will be fully validated in the future release as soon simulation is ready.

